  "title": "Bethel Church Redding, CA",
  "text": "Church\nGet Involved\nEvents\nSchools\nResources\nTestimoniesGive\nExperience God's presence at church this Sunday.\nON EARTH AS IT IS IN HEAVEN\nJoin in PersonJoin Online\nBethel is a congregation rooted in the love of God, and dedicated to worldwide transformation through revival.\nEvery believer was created to belong to a community. It was never God’s heart for us to do this life alone.\n\nBethel is a congregation of worshippers of Jesus Christ in Redding, California, who long to see hearts ignited until heaven meets earth. We are on the edge of the greatest revival of all time. Get involved and join us as we pursue the personal, regional, and global expansion of God's kingdom through His manifest presence.\n\nChurch NewsEvent Calendar\nMINISTRIES\nThere's a place for you in what God is doing in our house.\nConnect With a Ministry\nEVENTS\nYoung Saints Conference\n\nCome experience the power of the Holy Spirit at Young Saints Conference 2026.\n\nOct 23, 2026-Oct 24, 2026\nView EventRegister Now\nEncounter Jesus\nDo you know Jesus? Do you need physical healing or ministry? \nGod wants to transform your life with His love and power.\nMeet Jesus\nReceive Prophetic Prayer\nReceive Prayer for Healing\nReceive Inner Healing & Counseling\nBETHEL MUSIC\nNew Album: We Must Respond\nListen Now\nSCHOOLS\nResourcing Every Generation\nFOR REVIVAL\nBETHEL CHRISTIAN SCHOOL\nBETHEL SCHOOL OF SUPERNATURAL MINISTRY\nView Schools\nFUTURE CAMPUS\nWe are building a new campus. Help bring heaven to earth and invest in the future.\nLearn More\nEMAIL NEWSLETTER\nStay Connected\nABOUT\n\nBethel's mission is revival—the personal, regional, and global expansion of God's kingdom through His manifest presence.\n\nCONNECT\nWeekends\nGet Involved\nCalendar\nFeatured Events\nSchools\nContact Us\nRESOURCES\nBethel Online\nBethel Music\nCounseling\nLeaders Network\nPodcasts\nStore\nMORE\nGive\nCareers\nNews\nPrivacy\nTerms\nInvesting\n\nSOCIAL\n\nFacebook\n\nInstagram\n\nTwitter\n\nLinkedIn\n\nYouTube\n\nApple Music\n\nSpotify\n© 2022 - 2026 Bethel.com. All Rights Reserved.\nUpdates from Bethel Leadership →",
